{"id":"bed3ab01f1e969b7","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/073_等式逻辑_Equational_Logic.md","title":"073 等式逻辑 Equational Logic","display":"073_等式逻辑_Equational_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-等式签名\">1. 等式签名</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(Fun,ar)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma=(Fun,ar)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var,\\quad fun,\\quad eq.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var,\\quad fun,\\quad eq.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有逻辑连接词、量词、关系符号或子句构造子。</p>\n<p>本系统的目标差异为：主判断只在等式项语言中闭包理论参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>，规则只包含自反、对称、传递、同余和替换；它不含一阶谓词逻辑的量词、公理模式或归结规则。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项形成\">2. 项形成</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Fun\">\\(f\\in Fun\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(f)=n\">\\(ar(f)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(f)=0\">\\(ar(f)=0\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\varnothing)\">\\(fun(f,\\varnothing)\\)</span> 是常元项。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-等式形成\">3. 等式形成</h1>\n<p>等式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Eq_\\Sigma\">\\(Eq_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq(s,t)\\in Eq_\\Sigma\">\\(eq(s,t)\\in Eq_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>显示记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\approx t\">\\(s\\approx t\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq(s,t)\">\\(eq(s,t)\\)</span>。等式序列是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Eq_\\Sigma\">\\(Eq_\\Sigma\\)</span> 的有限序列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-自由变量、替换与无绑定约定\">4. 自由变量、替换与无绑定约定</h1>\n<p>项自由变量函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等式自由变量函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_E(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_E(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_\\Sigma=\\{\\theta:Var\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_\\Sigma=\\{\\theta:Var\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\)</span> 在项上由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\theta=\\theta(x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(x)\\theta=\\theta(x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)\\theta=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fun(f,\\tau)\\theta=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给出，并在等式上满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq(s,t)\\theta=eq(s\\theta,t\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq(s,t)\\theta=eq(s\\theta,t\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价是项和等式上的字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-等式理论参数\">5. 等式理论参数</h1>\n<p>等式逻辑的理论参数是任意集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq Eq_\\Sigma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E\\subseteq Eq_\\Sigma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这是本系统的唯一参数，最终元组中保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>理论公理行集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_E=E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_E=E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换闭包公理行集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_E^{sub}\n=\n\\{e\\theta:e\\in E,\\ \\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_E^{sub}\n=\n\\{e\\theta:e\\in E,\\ \\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-等式推理规则\">6. 等式推理规则</h1>\n<p>规则关系是下列五个关系的并集。其显示形式依次为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{}{t\\approx t},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\approx t}{t\\approx s},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\approx t\\quad t\\approx u}{s\\approx u},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{}{t\\approx t},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\approx t}{t\\approx s},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\approx t\\quad t\\approx u}{s\\approx u},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{(s_i\\approx t_i)_{i&lt;n}}{f(s_0,\\ldots,s_{n-1})\\approx f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\approx t}{s\\theta\\approx t\\theta}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{(s_i\\approx t_i)_{i&lt;n}}{f(s_0,\\ldots,s_{n-1})\\approx f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\approx t}{s\\theta\\approx t\\theta}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自反规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{refl}\n=\n\\{(\\varnothing,eq(t,t)):t\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{refl}\n=\n\\{(\\varnothing,eq(t,t)):t\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对称规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{sym}\n=\n\\{((eq(s,t)),eq(t,s)):s,t\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{sym}\n=\n\\{((eq(s,t)),eq(t,s)):s,t\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>传递规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{trans}\n=\n\\{((eq(s,t),eq(t,u)),eq(s,u)):s,t,u\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{trans}\n=\n\\{((eq(s,t),eq(t,u)),eq(s,u)):s,t,u\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>同余规则：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Fun\">\\(f\\in Fun\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(f)=n\">\\(ar(f)=n\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{cong,f}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\left(\n(eq(s_i,t_i))_{i&lt;n},\neq(fun(f,i\\mapsto s_i),fun(f,i\\mapsto t_i))\n\\right):\ns_i,t_i\\in Tm_\\Sigma\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{cong,f}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\left(\n(eq(s_i,t_i))_{i&lt;n},\neq(fun(f,i\\mapsto s_i),fun(f,i\\mapsto t_i))\n\\right):\ns_i,t_i\\in Tm_\\Sigma\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{sub}\n=\n\\{((eq(s,t)),eq(s\\theta,t\\theta)):s,t\\in Tm_\\Sigma,\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{sub}\n=\n\\{((eq(s,t)),eq(s\\theta,t\\theta)):s,t\\in Tm_\\Sigma,\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{Eq}=Rule_{refl}\\cup Rule_{sym}\\cup Rule_{trans}\\cup Rule_{sub}\\cup\\bigcup_{f\\in Fun}Rule_{cong,f}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{Eq}=Rule_{refl}\\cup Rule_{sym}\\cup Rule_{trans}\\cup Rule_{sub}\\cup\\bigcup_{f\\in Fun}Rule_{cong,f}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-等式证明对象\">7. 等式证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 出发的等式证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_i\\in Eq_\\Sigma\">\\(e_i\\in Eq_\\Sigma\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_i\">\\(e_i\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_i\\in Ax_E^{sub}\">\\(e_i\\in Ax_E^{sub}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varnothing,e_i)\\in Rule_{refl}\">\\((\\varnothing,e_i)\\in Rule_{refl}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((e_j),e_i)\\in Rule_{sym}\\cup Rule_{sub}\">\\(((e_j),e_i)\\in Rule_{sym}\\cup Rule_{sub}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((e_j,e_k),e_i)\\in Rule_{trans}\">\\(((e_j,e_k),e_i)\\in Rule_{trans}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Fun\">\\(f\\in Fun\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar(f)=n\">\\(ar(f)=n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_i&lt;i\">\\(j_i&lt;i\\)</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((e_{j_i})_{i&lt;n},e_i)\\in Rule_{cong,f}\">\\(((e_{j_i})_{i&lt;n},e_i)\\in Rule_{cong,f}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义行许可谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{Eq}(E,\\pi,i)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\pi(i)\\in Ax_E^{sub}\n\\vee\n(\\varnothing,\\pi(i))\\in Rule_{refl}\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists j&lt;i\\ ((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_{sym}\\cup Rule_{sub}\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists j,k&lt;i\\ ((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_{trans}\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists f\\in Fun\\ \\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists (j_q)_{q&lt;n}\n\\bigl(ar(f)=n\\wedge \\forall q&lt;n\\ j_q&lt;i\n\\wedge ((\\pi(j_q))_{q&lt;n},\\pi(i))\\in Rule_{cong,f}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{Eq}(E,\\pi,i)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\pi(i)\\in Ax_E^{sub}\n\\vee\n(\\varnothing,\\pi(i))\\in Rule_{refl}\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists j&lt;i\\ ((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_{sym}\\cup Rule_{sub}\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists j,k&lt;i\\ ((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_{trans}\\\\\n&amp;\\vee \\exists f\\in Fun\\ \\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists (j_q)_{q&lt;n}\n\\bigl(ar(f)=n\\wedge \\forall q&lt;n\\ j_q&lt;i\n\\wedge ((\\pi(j_q))_{q&lt;n},\\pi(i))\\in Rule_{cong,f}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{Eq}(E,\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{Eq}(E,\\pi)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Eq_\\Sigma\n\\wedge\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{Eq}(E,\\pi,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Eq_\\Sigma\n\\wedge\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{Eq}(E,\\pi,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-等式可导性\">8. 等式可导性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E\\vdash_{Eq}e\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\pi\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{Eq}(E,\\pi)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Last}_{Eq}(\\pi,e)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E\\vdash_{Eq}e\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\pi\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{Eq}(E,\\pi)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Last}_{Eq}(\\pi,e)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Last}_{Eq}(\\pi,e)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(m&gt;0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Eq_\\Sigma\\wedge \\pi(m-1)=e\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Last}_{Eq}(\\pi,e)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(m&gt;0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Eq_\\Sigma\\wedge \\pi(m-1)=e\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义理论闭包</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Cn_{Eq}(E)=\\{e\\in Eq_\\Sigma:E\\vdash_{Eq}e\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Cn_{Eq}(E)=\\{e\\in Eq_\\Sigma:E\\vdash_{Eq}e\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{Eq}\n=\n(Eq_\\Sigma,Ax_E^{sub},Rule_{Eq},\\operatorname{Proof}_{Eq},\\vdash_{Eq}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{Eq}\n=\n(Eq_\\Sigma,Ax_E^{sub},Rule_{Eq},\\operatorname{Proof}_{Eq},\\vdash_{Eq}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{EquationalLogic}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nE,\nTm_\\Sigma,\nEq_\\Sigma,\nFV_T,\nFV_E,\nSub_\\Sigma,\nAx_E^{sub},\nRule_{Eq},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{Eq},\n\\operatorname{Last}_{Eq},\n\\vdash_{Eq},\nCn_{Eq},\n\\Delta_{Eq}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{EquationalLogic}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nE,\nTm_\\Sigma,\nEq_\\Sigma,\nFV_T,\nFV_E,\nSub_\\Sigma,\nAx_E^{sub},\nRule_{Eq},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{Eq},\n\\operatorname{Last}_{Eq},\n\\vdash_{Eq},\nCn_{Eq},\n\\Delta_{Eq}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含项、等式、等式理论参数、等式推理规则和等式证明；不含量词、命题连接词、子句归结或结构解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-等式签名","text":"1. 等式签名","level":1},{"id":"2.-项形成","text":"2. 项形成","level":1},{"id":"3.-等式形成","text":"3. 等式形成","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由变量、替换与无绑定约定","text":"4. 自由变量、替换与无绑定约定","level":1},{"id":"5.-等式理论参数","text":"5. 等式理论参数","level":1},{"id":"6.-等式推理规则","text":"6. 等式推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-等式证明对象","text":"7. 等式证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-等式可导性","text":"8. 等式可导性","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(Fun,ar)","display":true},{"tex":"ar:Fun\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"var,\\quad fun,\\quad eq.","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Fun","display":false},{"tex":"ar(f)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"ar(f)=0","display":false},{"tex":"fun(f,\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"Eq_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"eq(s,t)\\in Eq_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"s\\approx t","display":false},{"tex":"eq(s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"Eq_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},","display":true},{"tex":"FV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i<ar(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)).","display":true},{"tex":"FV_E(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t).","display":true},{"tex":"Sub_\\Sigma=\\{\\theta:Var\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"var(x)\\theta=\\theta(x),","display":true},{"tex":"fun(f,\\tau)\\theta=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta)","display":true},{"tex":"eq(s,t)\\theta=eq(s\\theta,t\\theta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq Eq_\\Sigma.","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"Ax_E=E.","display":true},{"tex":"Ax_E^{sub}\n=\n\\{e\\theta:e\\in E,\\ \\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{}{t\\approx t},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\approx t}{t\\approx s},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\approx t\\quad t\\approx u}{s\\approx u},","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{(s_i\\approx t_i)_{i<n}}{f(s_0,\\ldots,s_{n-1})\\approx f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{n-1})},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{s\\approx t}{s\\theta\\approx t\\theta}.","display":true},{"tex":"Rule_{refl}\n=\n\\{(\\varnothing,eq(t,t)):t\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Rule_{sym}\n=\n\\{((eq(s,t)),eq(t,s)):s,t\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Rule_{trans}\n=\n\\{((eq(s,t),eq(t,u)),eq(s,u)):s,t,u\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in Fun","display":false},{"tex":"ar(f)=n","display":false},{"tex":"Rule_{cong,f}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\left(\n(eq(s_i,t_i))_{i<n},\neq(fun(f,i\\mapsto s_i),fun(f,i\\mapsto t_i))\n\\right):\ns_i,t_i\\in Tm_\\Sigma\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Rule_{sub}\n=\n\\{((eq(s,t)),eq(s\\theta,t\\theta)):s,t\\in Tm_\\Sigma,\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Rule_{Eq}=Rule_{refl}\\cup Rule_{sym}\\cup Rule_{trans}\\cup Rule_{sub}\\cup\\bigcup_{f\\in Fun}Rule_{cong,f}.","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi=(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})","display":true},{"tex":"e_i\\in Eq_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"e_i","display":false},{"tex":"e_i\\in Ax_E^{sub}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\varnothing,e_i)\\in Rule_{refl}","display":false},{"tex":"j<i","display":false},{"tex":"((e_j),e_i)\\in Rule_{sym}\\cup Rule_{sub}","display":false},{"tex":"j,k<i","display":false},{"tex":"((e_j,e_k),e_i)\\in Rule_{trans}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Fun","display":false},{"tex":"ar(f)=n","display":false},{"tex":"j_i<i","display":false},{"tex":"((e_{j_i})_{i<n},e_i)\\in Rule_{cong,f}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{Eq}(E,\\pi,i)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\pi(i)\\in Ax_E^{sub}\n\\vee\n(\\varnothing,\\pi(i))\\in Rule_{refl}\\\\\n&\\vee \\exists j<i\\ ((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_{sym}\\cup Rule_{sub}\\\\\n&\\vee \\exists j,k<i\\ ((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_{trans}\\\\\n&\\vee \\exists f\\in Fun\\ \\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists (j_q)_{q<n}\n\\bigl(ar(f)=n\\wedge \\forall q<n\\ j_q<i\n\\wedge ((\\pi(j_q))_{q<n},\\pi(i))\\in Rule_{cong,f}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proof}_{Eq}(E,\\pi)","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"m>0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Eq_\\Sigma\n\\wedge\n\\forall i<m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{Eq}(E,\\pi,i).","display":true},{"tex":"E\\vdash_{Eq}e\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\pi\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{Eq}(E,\\pi)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Last}_{Eq}(\\pi,e)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Last}_{Eq}(\\pi,e)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(m>0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Eq_\\Sigma\\wedge \\pi(m-1)=e\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"Cn_{Eq}(E)=\\{e\\in Eq_\\Sigma:E\\vdash_{Eq}e\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_{Eq}\n=\n(Eq_\\Sigma,Ax_E^{sub},Rule_{Eq},\\operatorname{Proof}_{Eq},\\vdash_{Eq}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{EquationalLogic}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nE,\nTm_\\Sigma,\nEq_\\Sigma,\nFV_T,\nFV_E,\nSub_\\Sigma,\nAx_E^{sub},\nRule_{Eq},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{Eq},\n\\operatorname{Last}_{Eq},\n\\vdash_{Eq},\nCn_{Eq},\n\\Delta_{Eq}\n\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":5010,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":[]}